  "goodToKnow": "Stationär means inpatient in medicine (stationär aufgenommen werden, to be admitted to hospital) and stationary or fixed elsewhere: der stationäre Handel (bricks-and-mortar shops), stationäre Blitzer (fixed speed cameras). The opposite in medicine is ambulant (outpatient). Die Station is a hospital ward. Stationery (paper goods) is Schreibwaren."
